        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "ae690f2a-6876-5ea8-a18b-aba090baab48",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bedknobs and Broomsticks, The Journey of Natty Gann\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Walt Disney Pictures, Buena Vista Distribution Company, Buena Vista Distribution\n- People: Arthur Gould-Porter, Jeremy Paul Kagan\n- Roles: Captain Greer, Ravenswood\n- Topics: film releases, acting career\n\nFacts:\n- Arthur Gould-Porter's film and television career spanned from 1942 to 1977.\n- Bedknobs and Broomsticks is a 1971 British-American musical fantasy film produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Buena Vista Distribution Company released Bedknobs and Broomsticks in North America on December 13, 1971.\n- Arthur Gould-Porter is remembered for playing Captain Greer in Bedknobs and Broomsticks.\n- The Journey of Natty Gann is a 1985 American film directed by Jeremy Paul Kagan.\n- Walt Disney Pictures produced The Journey of Natty Gann.\n- Buena Vista Distribution released The Journey of Natty Gann.\n- Arthur Gould-Porter also had a recurring role as Ravenswood the butler in The Beverley Hillbillies.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "9ccc9e85-84a0-5416-b497-14ac50d26363",
        "text": "Page: Bedknobs and Broomsticks. Sentence: Bedknobs and Broomsticks is a 1971 British-American musical fantasy film produced by Walt Disney Productions and released by Buena Vista Distribution Company in North America on December 13, 1971.\nPage: The Journey of Natty Gann. Sentence: The Journey of Natty Gann is a 1985 American film directed by Jeremy Paul Kagan, produced by Walt Disney Pictures and released by Buena Vista Distribution.\nPage: Arthur Gould-Porter. Sentence: His film and television career spanned from 1942 to 1977, and although mainly a character actor he is remembered for his part as Captain Greer in Disney's \"Bedknobs and Broomsticks\" and for his reoccurring role as Ravenswood the butler in \"The Beverley Hillbillies\".",
